- column  Nested absence
- row  `null`  no  the value itself  cannot be expressed
- row  `Option`  yes  wrapped in a `Some`  `Option[Option[T]]`, with no agreed meaning
- row  `Optional`  yes  the value itself  absorbed: `Optional[Optional[Int]]` is `Optional[Int]`
+ column  Representación
+ column  Visible en el tipo
+ column  Valor presente
+ column  Ausencia anidada
+ row  `null`  no  el propio valor  no puede expresarse
+ row  `Option`  sí  envuelto en un `Some`  `Option[Option[T]]`, sin significado acordado
+ row  `Optional`  sí  el propio valor  absorbida: `Optional[Optional[Int]]` es `Optional[Int]`

= row  `Optional`  yes  the value itself  absorbed: `Optional[Optional[Int]]` is `Optional[Int]`
